  "title": "Close Reading Check: Rhetoric in Douglass's \"What to the Slave Is the Fourth of July?\" (1852)",
  "instruction": "Swipe right if the statement about the passage is valid, left if it is invalid. Use the text, not your impressions.",
  "leftLabel": "Invalid",
